### Create User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "user12346",
  "password": "123456"
}

### get users
GET  http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### get user by id
GET  http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json